## 3. Architecture

### Application Structure

```
FeedBack_Project/
├── app/
│   ├── __init__.py              # App factory, CSRF, blueprint registration
│   ├── models.py                # 11 database models
│   ├── utils.py                 # Question-loading utility
│   ├── data/
│   │   ├── theory_questions.json   # 7 theory feedback questions
│   │   └── lab_questions.json      # 6 practical feedback questions
│   ├── routes/
│   │   ├── auth_routes.py       # Login, logout, password change
│   │   ├── admin_routes.py      # Admin portal (937 lines)
│   │   ├── teacher_routes.py    # Teacher portal (602 lines)
│   │   ├── student_routes.py    # Student portal (294 lines)
│   │   └── hod_routes.py        # HOD portal (345 lines)
│   └── templates/               # 36 HTML templates
│       ├── login.html, management_login.html
│       ├── student.html, feedback_form.html
│       ├── admin/  (15 templates)
│       ├── teacher/ (8 templates)
│       └── hod/     (9 templates)
├── config.py                    # DB config, connection pool
├── serve.py                     # Waitress production server
├── run.py                       # Database initialization
└── create_hod.py                # HOD account seeder
```

### Design Pattern: Blueprint Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["Flask App Factory"] --> B["Auth Blueprint<br/>/login, /logout"]
    A --> C["Admin Blueprint<br/>/admin/*"]
    A --> D["Teacher Blueprint<br/>/teacher/*"]
    A --> E["Student Blueprint<br/>/student/*"]
    A --> F["HOD Blueprint<br/>/hod/*"]
    G["CSRF Protection"] --> A
    H["SQLAlchemy DB"] --> A
```

