## 4. Database Design

### Entity-Relationship Diagram

```mermaid
erDiagram
    User ||--o{ Allocation : "teaches"
    User ||--o{ TokenLog : "generates"
    User ||--o{ ActiveTokenMap : "holds"
    User ||--o{ StudentElective : "enrolled in"
    User ||--o{ ClassTeacherAllocation : "assigned as"
    Session ||--o{ Allocation : "contains"
    Session ||--o{ TokenLog : "tracks"
    Subject ||--o{ Allocation : "allocated"
    Subject ||--o{ StudentElective : "elected"
    Allocation ||--o{ FeedbackResult : "receives"
    Allocation ||--o{ FeedbackComment : "receives"
    Session ||--o{ ReportApproval : "approved in"

    User {
        int userID PK
        string prn_empID UK
        string name
        string password
        enum role
        int semester
        string division
        string batch
    }
    
    Session {
        int sessionID PK
        string sessionName
        int status
    }
    
    Allocation {
        int allocationID PK
        int sessionID FK
        int teacherID FK
        int subjectID FK
        int targetSemester
        string targetDivision
        string targetBatch
    }

    FeedbackResult {
        int resultID PK
        int allocationID FK
        int sessionID FK
        int questionID
        int rating
    }
```

### 11 Database Models

| Model | Purpose | Key Features |
|---|---|---|
| [User](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#8-18) | All system users | Roles: admin, teacher, student, HOD |
| [Session](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#19-24) | Feedback sessions | Status: 0=Inactive, 1=Active, 2=Terminated |
| [Subject](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#25-34) | Academic subjects | Theory/Practical, elective flag, linked subjects |
| [StudentElective](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#35-44) | Elective enrollments | Maps student → elective subject + div/batch |
| [Allocation](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#45-57) | Form assignments | Links session + teacher + subject → target class |
| [TokenLog](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#58-64) | Submission tracking | Tracks token generation and submission per student |
| [ValidToken](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#65-69) | Token pool | All generated tokens with usage status |
| [ActiveTokenMap](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#70-75) | Live token mapping | Links student → active token (deleted after submit) |
| [FeedbackResult](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#76-83) | Individual ratings | One row per question per allocation |
| [FeedbackComment](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#84-90) | Free-text comments | Optional student comments per teacher |
| [ClassTeacherAllocation](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#91-98) | Class teacher mapping | Assigns teacher as class teacher for a division |
| [ReportApproval](file:///c:/Users/Keshav%20Kalani/Desktop/FeedBack_Project/app/models.py#99-111) | Approval workflow | Teacher agreement + HOD approval tracking |

